# Web3Forms — free contact-form delivery service.
#
# How to get your access key (takes ~2 minutes):
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter your email (dilshodbunyodov2020@gmail.com) — no signup required
# 3. They will email you an "access key" (a UUID like: abc123-...)
# 4. Copy it below and rename this file from `.env.example` to `.env`
#
# When VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY is set, the contact form will POST to Web3Forms
# and emails will be delivered to the address you registered with.
# If left empty, the form falls back to opening the user's mail client.

VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
